Management of forest areas include:
- Forest restoration, measuring and monitoring equipment;
- Integrated technologies: certified management systems applied to cultivated and non-cultivated forests.

Management of minerals include:
- Metal recycling ovens; 
- Glass recycling equipment;
- Equipment and other costs of scrap metal sorting and recovery;
- Recovery of materials (other than timber) from demolition sites;
- Production of recycled metal goods.

